<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8713" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθεμ-όεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εις</span>
		as fem., <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			2.695
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hes.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			16
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flowery,</i>
			of places, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν λειμῶνι Σκαμανδρίῳ ἀνθεμόεντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.467
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				695
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				12.88
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀνθεμόεντι Ἕβρῳ</span>
			on the <i>flowery</i> banks of Hebrus, <i><span class="en">
				15.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of works in
			metal, <i>adorned with flowers,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέβητ᾽ ἄπυρον . . ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.885
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἀ. λέβητι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.440
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρητῆρα πανάργυρον ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.275
				</span></i>
			; <i>embroidered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύπασσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.272
				</span></i>
			(<i><span class="en">
				Pers.
			</span></i>). (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθεμεῦντας</span> ps.-
				Ion.
			 form in <i><span class="en">
				Anacr.
				62
			</span></i>.)</div>
